    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwulajidwa kwa yisukulu ya Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu ŵakwete yisukulu 70 yayilume yiyatamaga mu msinda wa Samaliya. Yehu ŵalembile yikalata, ni ŵayitumisye ku Samaliya kwa ŵandu ŵakulamulila msindawo, kwa ŵandu ŵacikulile, ni kwa ŵandu ŵiŵalelaga yisukulu ya Ahabu. Yikalatayo yakwete maloŵe gakuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jemanja mkuyilolela yisukulu yambuje ŵenu Ahabu, soni mkwete mageleta, yida ya ngondo, ni misinda ja kulimba. Ni ligongo lyakwe patimpocele cikalataci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "msagule pasikati pa yisukulu ya ambuje ŵenu Ahabu, mundu jumo akusosekwa kuŵa mwenye, nipo mumjinjisye lina lya babagwe. Panyuma pakwe mliŵicile cile kumenyana ngondo pakusosa kulicenjela liŵasa lya ambuje ŵenu Ahabu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwa ŵa ku Samaliya ŵala piŵaŵalasile yikalatayo, wakamwile woga mnope, nipo ŵatite, “Ayimwene ŵaŵili ŵala, Yolamu ni Ahasiya ŵalepele kulimbana najo Yehu, nambi uweji mpaka tupakombole kulimbana najo jwalakweju?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo jwamkulungwa jwakulolela nyumba ja ucimwene ni soni jwamkulungwa jwakulolela msinda, pamo ni acakulungwakulungwa, kwisa soni ŵandu ŵiŵalelaga yisukuluyo, ŵatumisye maloŵe kwa Yehu gakuti, “Uweji tuli ŵandu ŵenu, soni tuli tayale kutenda yindu yiliyose yitimtusalile kuti tuyitende. Uweji ngatujinjisya mundu jwine kuti aŵe mwenye. Ŵalakwe atende yosope yitiyanonyele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵalembele soni ŵanduwo cikalata caŵili cakuti, “Naga jemanja mli panyuma pangu, ni soni naga mli tayale kumbikanila uneji, mjikate mitwe ja yisukulu ya Ahabu, ni myice najo kwa une akuno ku Yesilele malaŵi, ndaŵi mpela jinojino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwa ŵiŵalolelaga msinda wa Samaliya ula, ni ŵiŵalelaga yisukulu 70 ya Mwenye Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwa ŵa msinda ŵa Samaliya piŵapocele cikalataco, ŵayikamwile yisukulu yosope 70, ni ŵayiwuleje. Ŵajiŵisile mitwe jawo mu lukalala, ni ŵajitumisye kwa Yehu ku Yesilele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ŵayice jwamtenga kukumsalila Yehu kuti, “Mitwe ja yisukulu ya Ahabu ayice najo.” Jwalakwe ŵalamwile kuti, “Mkajiŵice mitwejo mawunjili pa cipata ca msinda uno, ni mkajilece papopo mpaka kundaŵi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kundaŵi kwakwe Yehu ŵajawile ku cipata ni ŵasalile ŵandu ŵiŵaliji pelepo, kuti, “Uneji ni junamjimucile Mwenye Yolamu nipo namwuleje, ngani jeleji jemanja ngajikumkwaya, nambo une. Sambano ngumwusya jemanja kuti, ana jwawuleje ŵandu wosopeŵa nduni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano m'manyilile kuti maloŵe gosope giŵaŵecete AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gakwayana ni ŵandu ŵa liŵasa lya Ahabu, gakwenela kutendeka. Ambuje ni ŵayitesile yosopeyi mpela muŵaŵecetele kupitila mwa Eliya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakutumicila jwawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe, Yehu ŵawuleje ŵandu ŵosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya Ahabu, ŵiŵaliji mkutama mu msinda wa Yesilele, nduna syakwe syosope, acimjakwe ŵakunguluka nawo wosope, mpaka soni ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵakwe, pangali jumo juŵamlesile cijumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 1:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Acalongo acimjakwe ŵa Ahasiya akuwulajidwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵatyosile ku Yesilele kuja ku Samaliya. Nipo ali mwitala ŵasimene ni acalongo acimjakwe ŵa Ahasiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda, pa malo gakolanjidwa kuti, “Malo gakusimanilana ŵakucinga.” Yehu ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana jemanja mli ŵani?” Jemanjajo ŵajanjile kuti, “Uweji tuli acalongo acimjakwe ŵa malemu Ahasiya, nipo tukuja kukunguluka ni ŵanace ŵa Yesebele, ni ŵandu ŵane ŵosope ŵa liŵasa lya ucimwene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12+2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12",
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵalamulile ŵakutumicila ŵakwe kuti, “Mwajigale ŵacijumi!” Ŵajigele ŵanduwo ŵacijumi ni ŵalongwesye ku cisima, cicaliji kumalo gakusimanilana ŵakucinga gala, kweleko ŵandu 42 wosope ŵawuleje, ni nganamleka amta jumo jwacijumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Acalongo acimjakwe ŵakusigala ŵa Ahabu akuwulajidwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵapelengenye ulendo ŵakwe, ni ŵasimene ni Yonadabu mwanace jwa Lekabu, juŵayice kukumcingamila. Myoyo Yehu ŵamkomasisye jwalakwejo, ni ŵamsalile kuti, “M'mwejo ni uneji tukwete nganisyo syakulandana. Ana timŵe kunyuma kwangu kungamucisya?” Yonadabu ŵajanjile kuti, “Elo, tinakamucisye.” Yehu ŵatite, “Naga yimkuŵecetayo yili yakuwona, mungamule mkono ŵangu.” Myoyo Yonadabu ŵapelece mkono wakwe, Yehu ŵamkamwile mkono wakwewo ni ŵamkwesisye pegeleta lyakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni ŵamsalile kuti, “Kwende tulongane, mkalole mwasyene yinguti pakulipeleka kwa AMBUJE.” Myoyo ŵajesile najo mwigeleta mwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ayice ku Samaliya, Yehu ŵawuleje wosope ŵiŵasigalile, ŵa mwiŵasa lya Ahabu, mpaka ŵamasile wosope. Ŵayitesile yindu yeleyi pakuya maloŵe ga AMBUJE gele giŵaŵecete Eliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵakulambila milungu ja Baala akuwulajidwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵasongenye ŵandu wosope ŵa mu msinda wa Samaliya pa malo gamo, ni ŵasalile kuti, “Mwenye Ahabu ŵatumicilaga Baala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " panandipe. Nambo une Yehu, tinamtumicile kwejinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano mumbilanjile ŵakulocesya wosope ŵa Baala, wosope ŵakusapopela Baalajo, pamo ni ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵakwe wosope. Akasigala mundu jwine jwalijose jwangayika, pakuŵa ngusosa kutaga mbopesi jajikulungwa kwa Baala. Jutalepele kwika, taciwulajidwa.” Yehu ŵayitesile yindu yeleyi mwakalamuka, pakutenda myoyo ŵasakaga kuti ŵajonanje ŵandu wosope ŵaŵalambilaga Baala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yehu ŵalamwile kuti, “Ajenesye kuti kwana msongano ŵakucimbicisya Baala.” Ŵandu ŵawujenesye msonganowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵatumisye maloŵe kucilambo cosope ca Isalaeli. Nipo ŵandu ŵosope ŵiŵapopelaga Baala, kweli ŵayice, nipo kwaliji kwangali mundu jwalijose juŵasigele. Piŵayice, ŵandu wosopewo ŵajinjile m'nyumba jakupopelela Baala, mpaka ŵagumbele kuti pyetete m'nyumbamo. Nginigasigala malo galigose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ni ŵamsalile jwakutaga mbopesi jwamkulungwa juŵalolelaga yakuwala kuti, “Myice nayo yakuwala yapajika yakwanila ŵandu wosope ŵakumpopela Baala.” Jwakutaga mbopesijo ŵajigalile yakuwala ŵandu ŵala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵajinjile m'nyumba ja Baala pamo ni Yonadabu, mwanace jwa Lekabu, ni ŵasalile ŵandu ŵaliji mwelemo kuti, “Mlolecesye cenene kuti akapagwa mundu jwakutumicila AMBUJE pasikati penu, nambo amuno awe ŵakupopela Baalape basi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Yehu ni Yonadabu ŵajinjile mkati mwa nyumba ja Baala, kuja kutaga mbopesi syakutinisya kwa Baala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵaliji ali ŵaŵisile asilikali 80 kusa kwa nyumba ja Baalajo, ni ŵasalile kuti, “Mkwenela kwawulaga ŵandu wosopeŵa. Jwalijose jwa jemanja jutamkulupusye mundu jwalijose, mwa ŵandu ŵinampele kuti mwawulajewa, nombe najo tawulajidwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ali amasile kutaga mbopesi sya kutinisya sila, ŵasalile asilikali ŵakwe ni acikapitawo ŵawo kuti, “Jinjilani mwawulaje wosope! Akasakulupuka mundu jwalijose.” Asilikaliwo pamo ni acikapitawo ŵawo ŵala, ŵajinjile ni mawupanga gawo ni ŵawuleje ŵandu wosope ŵaŵaliji mwelemo, ni ŵajikopwesye mitembo jawo pasa. Ŵajinjile soni mcipinda ca mkati ca nyumba ja Baala jila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ŵacikopwesye cipilala ca pajika cicaliji mcipindamo ca Baala, ni ŵacijocile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo asilikaliwo ŵacijonasile cipilala ca pajika ca Baala, ŵajijonasile soni nyumba jakwe, nipo akujikamulisya masengo nyumbajo mpela cimbusi mpaka lelo jino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwelemu ni muŵalekasisye Yehu kulambila milungu ja Baala, mcilambo ca Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Yehu nganaleka kulambila milungu jagumba ja ŵanace ŵa ng'ombe ŵa golidi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jiŵaŵisile Yelobowamu ku Beteli ni ku Dani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.28+1KI.12.29+1KI.12.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 12:28-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵamsalile Yehu kuti, “Ligongo lyakuti mtesile yindu yambone, pakulijonanga liŵasa lyosope lya Ahabu, mpela munasoselaga uneji. Myoyo une tindolecesye kuti ayimwene mcece ŵa mcilambo ca Isalaeli, ŵatajinjile msogolo mwenu, tacityocela mwiŵasa lyenu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Yehu nganasamala Malamusi ga AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, ni mtima wakwe wosope. Ŵakuyisye kutenda yakusakala yiŵatesile Yelobowamu, juŵalongolele Aisalaeli kulemwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwa kwa Yehu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masiku gelego AMBUJE ŵatandite kucinandiya cilambo ca Isalaeli. Mwenye Hasaele jwa ku Siliya ŵacisumwile cilambo cosope ca Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ŵaliji mkulamulila yilambo ya Giliyadi ni Bashani yiyaliji kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Lusulo lwa Yolodani ni ca kumpoto kwa msinda wa Aloeli uwaliji mungulugulu mwa Lusulo lwa Alinoni. Jeleji ni jaliji mbali ja cilambo ciŵatamaga ŵandu ŵa m'maŵasa ga Gadi, Lubeni ni Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yindu yosope yiŵatesile Yehu piŵaliji mwenye yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵawile nipo ŵamsicile m'malembe ga ku Samaliya, nipo Yehowahasi mwanagwe ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵalamulile cilambo ca Isalaeli, ali ku Samaliya kwa yaka 28.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
